sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Main as Main Thread(Render/UI)
    participant Worker as Watcher Thread
    participant FS as File System
    participant Timer as Debounce Timer

    User->>Main: Select Fragment Shader File

    Main->>Main: set_target_file(path)

    Main->>Worker: m_change_target_signal

    Worker->>Worker: on_change_target()
    Worker->>Worker: stop old watcher
    Worker->>Worker: start new watcher

    FS-->>Worker: file changed event

    Worker->>Worker: on_fs_event()

    Worker->>Timer: reset/start debounce timer

    FS-->>Worker: more file changes(optional)

    Worker->>Timer: reset timer again

    Timer-->>Worker: timeout

    Worker->>Worker: on_debounce_timer()

    Worker->>Main: shader_file_change_signal

    Main->>Main: on_shader_file_change_callback()

    Main->>Main: read shader file

    Main->>Main: compile new shader

    alt compile success
        Main->>Main: replace old shader
    else compile failed
        Main->>Main: keep old shader
    end

    Main->>Main: render updated frame

    Main->>Worker: stop signal

    Worker->>Worker: close fs watcher
    Worker->>Worker: close timer
    Worker->>Worker: stop uv loop

    Worker-->>Main: thread exit